  "short_description": "COP BASTARD 是一款以 90 年代初期日本為背景的經典 FPS。化身強悍刑警，在狹窄走廊中迎戰一波波極道，體驗受 90 年代動作電影啟發的火爆戰鬥。沒有謎題、技能加成或升級，只有走廊、敵人，以及朝他們臉上吐口水的機會。",
  "short_description_en": "COP BASTARD is a classic FPS set in early ’90s Japan. Play as a tough detective and blast through waves of yakuza in relentless action inspired by ’90s films. No puzzles, perks or upgrades - just corridors, enemies and the chance to spit in their faces.",
